1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Pi Oasis: a game oasis inside Pi Browser. Free to play.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:14,000
To start, open Pi Browser, find Pi Oasis, and tap Open. Sign in with Pi and you are in.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,170
Tap the palm to knock dates down. Every tenth hit is golden, and your energy comes back with time.

4
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,900
Everything is on one home screen.

5
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:33,420
Jerry Kombat: tap to earn coins, collect cards and fight the community boss.

6
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:38,630
Camel Derby: train your racing camels and enter the weekly races.

7
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:43,830
Jerry Castle: build towers along the path and stop the army.

8
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:48,230
Buy, breed and collect camels that make dates for you.

9
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:52,640
Build your oasis city and fill orders to grow it.

10
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:58,650
Save dates in the granary and get them back with a bonus.

11
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:03,850
Spin the daily wheel, finish quests and play arcade games.

12
00:01:03,850 --> 00:01:09,050
Collect rare cards and complete your album.

13
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:14,250
Trade with other players in the market.

14
00:01:14,250 --> 00:01:19,450
Chat with friends in the public room or in private.

15
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:24,640
Your box keeps your gifts, your JRY and your waiting prizes.

16
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:30,050
Read manga, guides and watch documentaries in Jerry Magazine.

17
00:01:30,050 --> 00:01:33,710
Every day there is a gift code. The first players to use it win a reward.

18
00:01:33,710 --> 00:01:39,110
Supporters can join the VIP Club, with its Hall of Glory and the Sultan's Caravan game.

19
00:01:39,110 --> 00:01:43,750
Climb the weekly ranking. Prizes and items are in the game.

20
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:53,750
Pi Oasis. Open Pi Browser and search for Pi Oasis. A game for fun, with no promise of profit.

